  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Books and Library for children in rural Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia is facing a literacy emergency! The geographical conditions of Indonesia, with its islands and mountainous terrain, make it more challenging to distribute access to education and suitable reading materials for children. Uneven technological advancements further compound the difficulties faced by children in the mountains and remote areas in accessing proper reading materials and textbooks.</narrative>
  </description>
